pute ${f}^{′}(-2)$, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(-2)=2(-2)-3=-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we use the point-slope form with $m=-7$ and the coordinates of our point $(-2,10),$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-(10) & =-7(x-(-2)) \\\\ y-10 & =-7(x+2) \\\\ y & =-7x-14+10 \\\\ y & =-7x-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243550 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243551 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243552 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243553 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243554 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1041 "selection" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243554 13194139533641 true] [17592186243549 1110 #uuid "27deb4de-d4b9-5cff-b0ef-0adbaeb6e1dc" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243550 1034 "y=6x+2" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243550 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243550 1111 #uuid "18bdab51-0147-5c8b-b94e-2041f82148a4" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243551 1034 "y=-7x+4" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243551 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243551 1111 #uuid "387fb26a-4e48-5d6b-9255-3ca5eccbb7e6" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243552 1034 "y=6x-2" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243552 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243552 1111 #uuid "5c16cc39-de34-5f61-a84a-61a9ef3004bb" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243553 1034 "y=-x-2" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243553 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243553 1111 #uuid "ca42379d-7f88-5ea1-911e-c18d0f47196e" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243554 1034 "y=-7x-4" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243554 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243554 1111 #uuid "bab51252-132e-534d-a533-853576db4230" 13194139533641 true] [