rivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x-{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}) \\\\  & =4-2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the slope of the tangent at our point is\n\n$$\nm={f}^{′}(1)=4-2(1)=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the tangent is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-3 & =2(x-1) \\\\ y & =2x-2+3 \\\\ y & =2x+1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find where the tangent line intercepts the $y$-axis, we set $x=0$ and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =2(0)+1 \\\\ y & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point of intersection is $(0,1).$" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243570 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243571 13194139533641 true] [17592186243570 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243572 13194139533641 true] [17592186243570 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533641 true] [17592186243570 1041 "field-1" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243570 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243572 13194139533641 true] [17592186243570 1110 #uuid "a843db39-7c78-587a-8d82-b933b84b4cc4" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243571 1034 "1" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243571 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243571 1111 #uuid "36d507d0-340d-5078-bf7c-81166bcf902e" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243572 1034 "0" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243572 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243572 1111 #uuid "78cc7ee4-05a1-5daa-9eac-bce5ae3be9e1" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243574 13194139533641 true] [17592186243573 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533641 true] [17592186243573 1041 "field-2" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243573 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243574 13194139533641 true] [17592186243573 1110 #uuid "1ead8a6d-45aa-590a-9cd5-208f392b486c" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243574 1034 "1" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243574 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243574 1111 #uuid "e1ba1433-4af8-59fd-9b6b-481a3eea28d3" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243575 1017 #edb/ref 17592186243576 13194139533641 true] [17592186243575 1089 "q-342363" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243575 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533641 true] [17592186243575 1100 "Find the equation of the tangent to the curve $y=4\\sqrt[3]{x}$ at the point $(8,8).$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243575 1113 #uuid "8675848b-359e-5358-9ed8-913d5be71171" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243575 1138 false 13194139533641 true] [17592186243575 1145 "Let $f(x)=4\\sqrt[3]{x}.$ Computing the derivative ${f}^{′}(x)$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4\\sqrt[3]{x}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt[3]{x}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{1/3}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}{x}^{-2/3} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe then compute ${f}^{′}(8)$, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(8) & =\\frac{4}{3\\sqrt[3]{{8}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3\\sqrt[3]{64}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3\\cdot 4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we use the point-slope form with $m=\\frac{1}{3}$ and the coordinates of our point $(8,8),$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-8 & =\\frac{1}{3}(x-8) \\\\ y & =\\frac{1}{3}x-\\frac{8}{3}+8 \\\\ y & =\\frac{1}{3}x+\\frac{16}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243576 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243577 13194139533641 true] [17592186243576 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533641 true] [17592186243576 1041 "field-1" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243576 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243577 13194139533641 true] [17592186243576 1110 #uuid "974c793b-3d07-5517-946e-8468b4b17481" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243577 1034 "\\frac{x}{3}+\\frac{16}{3}" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533641 true] [17592186243577 1111 #uuid "3e629624-0acf-5467-9cf2-d1187d2ce9f6" 13194139533641 true] [17592186243578 1017 #edb/ref 175921862